m/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-08-10T14:56:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T21:14:11Z","closed_at":"2025-08-22T21:14:11Z","assignee":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: all snapshots between 4.5.dev1 and 4.5.beta5\n- Not reproducible in: 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 Ti (nvidia; 550.163.01) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8700K CPU @ 3.70GHz (12 threads) - 15.57 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm creating 2D platformer and I want to add semisolid tiles that can stack on top of each other.\n\nSince [GH-102662](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102662) adjacent tiles merge into bigger collision shapes. This process doesn't respect one-way property of shapes and always merge them.\nIn my case this leads to only topmost tile having one-way collision.\nThis can be fixed by setting 'physics_quadrant_size' to 1.\n\nphysics_quadrant_size = 16\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15f3fa49-877c-4251-ae32-f5cdea2b7db0\n\nphysics_quadrant_size = 1\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f494e423-0756-483b-aaed-ce220d50f01c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMRP:\n1. Open project;\n2. Run it (Controls: left and right arrows, space for jump);\n3. Notice that only topmost tiles have one-way collision.\n\nManual:\n1. Add TileMapLayer to scene;\n2. Add tile and assign shape with one-way collision to it;\n3. Draw tiles and stack them on top of each other;\n4. Add CharacterBody2D with rectangle shape and attach short script for platformer controls:\n```GDScript\nextends CharacterBody2D\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvelocity.x = 500.0 * Input.get_axis(&\"ui_left\", &\"ui_right\")\n\tvelocity.y += 1000.0 * delta\n\t\n\tif is_on_floor() and Input.is_action_just_pressed(&\"ui_accept\"):\n\t\tvelocity.y -= 600.0            \n\t\n\tmove_and_slide()\n```\n5. Run project and notice that only topmost tiles have one-way collision.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[OneWayTilesBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21705858/OneWayTilesBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109492/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109492/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}